 title='EcoSize-CXW-111 Sizing Agent | PVA Replacement',
 meta='EcoSize-CXW-111: all-in-one warp sizing powder that replaces PVA and powder chemicals. 25 KG bag or 100 KG drum. Contact Seamens, Lahore.',
