 title='EcoShort-GS-777 Sizing Agent | Size, Lubricant, Binder',
 meta='EcoShort-GS-777: multi-polymer film forming organic sizing paste that works as size, lubricant and binder in one. 125–240 KG packs. Seamens, Lahore.',
